[en.FOCUS_C12_LIMESTONE_PIES_REVENGE]
Limestone Pie’s Revenge

[en.FOCUS_C12_LIMESTONE_PIES_REVENGE_desc]
The Empire took my dearest sister and left her without a trace. It also took my dearest friend and parents. Every pony on the Rock Farm lost too much after Jahr Null. I will make the Empire pay the most terrible price for everything it stole.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_LIMESTONE_PIES_REVENGE]
石青派的复仇

[zh.FOCUS_C12_LIMESTONE_PIES_REVENGE_desc]
帝国夺走了我最亲爱的妹妹，让她从此杳无音讯；它也夺走了我最亲爱的朋友和父母。整个采石农场在新元年后失去了太多。我要让帝国为它夺走的一切付出最惨痛的代价。

